@startuml
actor User
participant Main
participant TransactionManager
participant AnomalyDetector
participant FlaggedTransaction
participant ReportGenerator

User -> Main : Select Run Fraud Detection
Main -> User : Request user ID
User --> Main : Enter user ID
Main -> TransactionManager : getTransactionsByUser(userId)
TransactionManager --> Main : List<Transaction>
Main -> AnomalyDetector : detectDuplicates(transactions)
AnomalyDetector -> FlaggedTransaction : Create duplicate flags
AnomalyDetector --> Main : Duplicate flags
Main -> AnomalyDetector : detectSpikes(transactions)
AnomalyDetector -> FlaggedTransaction : Create spike flags
AnomalyDetector --> Main : Spike flags
Main -> AnomalyDetector : detectOddTiming(transactions)
AnomalyDetector -> FlaggedTransaction : Create odd-timing flags
AnomalyDetector --> Main : Odd-timing flags
Main -> ReportGenerator : generateFlaggedReport(userId)
ReportGenerator --> Main : Display formatted report
Main --> User : Show detection results
@enduml
